  "description": "The LoadBearing xUnit adapter: derive a test class from ArchRuleTests<TSpec> and every rule in the architecture spec becomes an individually named xUnit test, with failure text identical to the loadbearing CLI. Requires xunit.v3 4.0.0 or later, which runs on Microsoft.Testing.Platform rather than VSTest, and a .NET SDK on the test host (the checker loads the target solution through MSBuildWorkspace).",
